  "bodyHash": "+Ou2gODsCUc=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dd58dfe8-1df6-4e86-8569-b60fd4427e2b.png\" alt=\"TerraFirmaGreg史诗骑士模组标志\" width=\"850\" height=\"472\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>作为原版《TerraFirma史诗骑士》的作者，我终于为著名的模组包TerraFirmaGreg-Modern制作了兼容版本，因为存在许多差异导致基础KOTF与该模组包不兼容。</p><p>有人可能会问，如果只需一个数据包就足够，为何还要制作另一个模组、另一个页面？</p><p>答案是，这个版本将来会独立支持，重新设计所有武器和盔甲以适应模组包而非基础TFC，并且后续可能需要对代码进行一些额外调整。</p><p>以下描述只是原模组页面的复制，但会根据所做的更改进行相应修改。</p><p>请将所有问题报告到GitHub Issues。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_2ced21a1-0607-42c4-bfeb-9346947b31c6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"62\"></p><p>本模组旨在让<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士：盾牌、盔甲与武器</a></strong>及其附加内容尽可能兼容<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrafirmacraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCraft</a></strong>。截至<strong>3.0</strong>版本，<strong>TerraFirma史诗骑士</strong>包含<strong><em>900+</em></strong>物品，包括<em>武器</em>、<em>盾牌</em>和<em>盔甲</em>，涵盖<strong>TFC</strong>生存模式中所有可用材料。<strong>史诗骑士</strong>和<strong>史诗骑士：古董遗产</strong>的资源经过重新设计以匹配<strong>TFC</strong>艺术风格，相应物品也重新平衡以适应<strong>TFC</strong>玩法。盔甲属性可通过配置自定义！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_975b12a1-f75e-40a4-8214-974698f1d3b4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"62\"></p><p>截至<strong>3.0</strong>版本，<strong>TerraFirma史诗骑士</strong>模组开箱即用地支持<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></strong>，并且不太可能与其他任何模组产生冲突。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_e0572cef-4c09-4f4d-b7a4-ff41983b0d5b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"66\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_274c52a1-3723-4435-b7c3-f21bb3ef0624.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"942\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_4fbbf070-ada0-4680-abbb-d890cb756057.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_c578c568-bb70-4f76-a01e-5bec8db26ff6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"710\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_16e51fed-094c-4478-b404-8d75e530a1e8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"67\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_5d77e783-308e-4640-ba39-446abb87407a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"260\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_32b0f980-0c3b-4ad4-946e-fc8787c94b3e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"571\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_3531e109-b66f-441c-a432-f631c79af3de.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"66\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_70c95701-bf7a-4465-8839-c804588652fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"436\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_7ed83493-8ecd-43be-a973-aa0971ffe128.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_c2005522-0356-477d-961c-b8d23aede9e1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"712\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_b5637dd0-782e-4a25-b383-bf4141bd9adc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"476\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_bd8c0bcd-6573-493b-a6f4-76cf15ef5891.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"335\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_0434a30e-7e4f-49b6-8b9e-adbcbb28eb61.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p><p>目前的路线图大概是这样的，哈哈：</p><ul>\n<li>重新设计所有纹理以符合TerraFirmaGreg的美学。</li>\n</ul><p>不过，这不会很快实现。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_a1ededac-9c40-4f41-9faf-76c51167c006.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p><p>我要衷心感谢<strong>Magistu</strong>愿意回答关于他模组“内部”的每一个问题，感谢<strong>SomeIdiot13</strong>（当前的Discord昵称）调试和测试我的模组，感谢<strong>StaxiHD</strong>帮助处理纹理和德语翻译，以及感谢<strong>MrHiTech</strong>创建了如此出色的数据包，最终演变成了这个模组。额外感谢<strong>Yappit1</strong>、<strong>Seagullible</strong>、<strong>sossololpipi</strong>在游玩<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/terrafirmacultures-s2\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCultures</a>时测试和调试我的模组。</p>",
